                GitHub collaboration (option 21)
                   Lists/views/creates pull requests and issues, submits PR
                   reviews, and performs a read-only branch-protection, Actions
                   secret-name, and workflow-run audit. Does not merge or close.

                Remotes (option 22)
                   Lists, adds, changes, renames, removes, and prunes local
                   remote names/URLs. Never deletes anything on the server.

                Worktrees/submodules (option 23)
                   Lists/adds/removes worktrees, prunes stale metadata, lists/updates/
